      <root>
        <mxCell id="0" />
        <mxCell id="1" parent="0" />
        <UserObject label="" plantUmlData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;@startuml\ntitle Traffic Timing Decision\n\nautonumber\n\nactor \&quot;Launch Manager\&quot; as LM\nparticipant \&quot;Health Monitor\&quot; as Health\nparticipant \&quot;Logger\&quot; as Logger\nparticipant \&quot;Analytics\&quot; as Analytics\nqueue \&quot;Snapshot Queue\&quot; as Queue\nparticipant \&quot;Periodic RT Thread\&quot; as RT\nparticipant \&quot;Traffic Data Receiver\&quot; as Receiver\nparticipant \&quot;Decision Engine\&quot; as Decision\nparticipant \&quot;Constraint Manager\&quot; as Constraint\nparticipant \&quot;TimingPlan Publisher\&quot; as Publisher\nactor \&quot;Traffic Signal Controller\&quot; as FSM\n\nnote left of LM\nPeriod = 2.5 s\nend note\nloop \n\nRT -&gt;&gt; Health : startReportHealth()\nactivate RT\nactivate Health\n\nHealth -&gt; Health : recordStartTimestamp()\nactivate Health\nHealth --&gt;&gt; Health : recordStatus\ndeactivate Health\n\nRT -&gt;&gt; Receiver : activateDecisionCycle()\nactivate Receiver\n\nReceiver -&gt; Queue : SnapshotRequest()\nactivate Queue\nQueue --&gt;&gt; Receiver : TrafficSnapshot\ndeactivate Queue\n\nReceiver -&gt; Receiver : validateSnapshot()\nactivate Receiver\nReceiver --&gt;&gt; Receiver : ValidationResult\ndeactivate Receiver\n\n\nopt Snapshot valid\n\n    Receiver -&gt;&gt; Decision : processTrafficMetrics(metrics)\n    deactivate Receiver\n    activate Decision\n\n    Decision -&gt; Decision : detectEmergency()\n    activate Decision\n    Decision --&gt;&gt; Decision : EmergencyStatus\n    deactivate Decision\n\n    alt Emergency detected\n\n        Decision -&gt; Decision : setEmergencyFlags()\n        activate Decision\n        Decision --&gt;&gt; Decision : TimingPlan\n        deactivate Decision\n\n        Decision -&gt;&gt; Publisher : TimingPlan(previousPlan, emergencyFlags)\n        \n        deactivate Decision        \n        activate Publisher\n        \n        Publisher -&gt; FSM : publishTimingPlan(TimingPlan)\n        activate FSM\n        FSM --&gt;&gt; Publisher : ACK / NACK\n        deactivate FSM\n        deactivate Publisher\n\n    else Normal traffic\n\n        activate Decision\n        Decision -&gt; Decision : calculateDemandScore()\n        activate Decision\n        Decision --&gt;&gt; Decision : TrafficDemandScore\n        deactivate Decision\n\n        Decision -&gt; Decision : assignGreenTime()\n        activate Decision\n        Decision --&gt;&gt; Decision : DraftTimingPlan\n        deactivate Decision\n\n        Decision -&gt;&gt; Constraint : DraftTimingPlan\n        \n        deactivate Decision\n        activate Constraint\n\n        Constraint -&gt; Constraint : applyTimingConstraints()\n        activate Constraint\n        Constraint --&gt;&gt; Constraint : AdjustedTimingPlan\n        deactivate Constraint\n\n        Constraint -&gt; Constraint : validateCycleLength()\n        activate Constraint\n        Constraint --&gt;&gt; Constraint : ValidatedTimingPlan\n        deactivate Constraint\n\n        Constraint -&gt;&gt; Publisher : ValidatedTimingPlan\n        deactivate Constraint\n\n        activate Publisher\n        Publisher -&gt; FSM : publishTimingPlan(TimingPlan)\n        activate FSM\n        FSM --&gt;&gt; Publisher : ACK / NACK\n        deactivate FSM\n        deactivate Publisher\n\n    end\n\ndeactivate Decision\n\nend\nRT -&gt;&gt; Health : decisionCycleFinished()\ndeactivate RT\n\nHealth -&gt; Health : recordFinishTimestamp()\nactivate Health\nHealth --&gt;&gt; Health : recordStatus\ndeactivate Health\n\nHealth -&gt; Health : calculateExecutionTime()\nactivate Health\nHealth --&gt;&gt; Health : executionTime\ndeactivate Health\n\nHealth -&gt; Health : compareWithDeadline()\nactivate Health\nHealth --&gt;&gt; Health : deadlineStatus\ndeactivate Health\n\nHealth -&gt;&gt; LM : AliveNotification\n\n    Health -&gt;&gt; Logger : logTimingData()\ndeactivate Health\n    activate Logger\n\n    \n    Logger -&gt; Logger : storeTimingData()\n\n\nactivate Logger\n    Logger --&gt;&gt; Logger : LogData\n    deactivate Logger\nend\n\n    Logger -&gt;&gt; Analytics : processLogData(LogData)\ndeactivate Logger\n    activate Analytics\n\n    Analytics -&gt; Analytics : calculateStatistics()\n\nactivate Analytics\n    Analytics --&gt;&gt; Analytics : BenchmarkData\ndeactivate Analytics\n\n    deactivate Analytics\n    \n\n    deactivate RT\n\n\n\n\n\n@enduml&quot;,&#xa;  &quot;config&quot;: null&#xa;}" id="rgsY4il1LZiOfx3R62kq-1">
